Warning [jet.CompoundAssignment]: Prefer `p.hp -= …` instead of repeating the left side
  --> tests/ui_lint/prefer_compound_assign.jet:5:44
    |
  5 | damage: fn(p: &Player, amount: Int) { p.hp = p.hp - amount }
    |                                            ^
 Why: Compound assignment updates a place in one step without restating it
 Fix: Write `p.hp -= …`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/L0503

Warning [jet.CompoundAssignment]: Prefer `p.hp += …` instead of repeating the left side
  --> tests/ui_lint/prefer_compound_assign.jet:7:42
